  "description": "Stop fighting the legacy WinForms DataGridView. ModernDataGridView.WinForms is the ultimate zero-dependency, hardware-accelerated replacement. It eliminates flickering and slow rendering by using a custom GDI+ engine. Includes built-in Pagination, smartphone-style Kinetic Scrolling, in-cell Sparklines and DataBars, conditional formatting, Master-Detail row expansion, and one-click data export to CSV/JSON/XML/PDF. Features native Dark Mode and 5 premium design styles out of the box. Drop it in and instantly modernize your enterprise desktop apps.",
